Implement: on draw, draw background with dark space gradient. draw stars: generate array of star positions once. add star twinkling.

Also improve health bar display as hearts using emojis? Not requested. Keep ASCII.

Implement modifications with edit tool.

We'll need to read current code and modify.

Plan: Add at top after const ctx definitions: generate stars array. const starCount = 100; const stars = []; for loop to random x,y,size.

Add in draw: fillRect with gradient. Use ctx.fillStyle = gradient; ctx.fillRect(0,0,width,height);

Define gradient each frame: const bgGrad = ctx.createLinearGradient(0,0,width, height); bgGrad.addColorStop(0,'#000020'); bgGrad.addColorStop(1,'#000000');

Draw stars: stars.forEach(s => { ctx.fillStyle = 'rgba(255,255,255,'+s.alpha+')'; ctx.fillRect(s.x,s.y,s.size,s.size); });

For ship, draw triangle: ctx.fillStyle = ship.color; ctx.beginPath(); ctx.moveTo(ship.x, ship.y+ship.h); ctx.lineTo(ship.x+ship.w/2, ship.y); ctx.lineTo(ship.x+ship.w, ship.y+ship.h); ctx.closePath(); ctx.fill();

